# LoopMaster Cursor Rules

- NEVER use `transform.Find(...)` or `GameObject.Find(...)`.
- Always use `HierarchyReferenceCache` (`HierarchyReferenceCache.Child(...)`, `HierarchyReferenceCache.Descendant(...)`, `HierarchyReferenceCache.Path(...)`, `HierarchyReferenceCache.ChildComponent<T>(...)`, `HierarchyReferenceCache.DescendantComponent<T>(...)`) or serialized fields (`[SerializeField]`).
- All runtime scripts must satisfy `VerifyNoFindPolicy()` in `ReverseEngineering/Verification/Program.cs`.
